    const col = await tryAgent(`${CREDS}

You are the COLLATE step for ghost ${lp.id} into the integration worktree ${INTEG_WT} (branch ${INTEG_BRANCH}). The lane committed ${r.ghost_commit_sha} on its branch ${r.branch}, forked at base ${r.base_sha}. Collation is LINEAR — cherry-pick, NEVER merge. Do EXACTLY, in order:
