5. ONLY if step 4's cherry-pick exited 0: reap the ghost worktree \`"$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)/${WT_SCRIPT}" remove g${lp.id.slice(0,8)}\` (cherry-pick MUST precede reap — remove deletes the branch and would orphan the commit otherwise; NEVER reap after a failed pick). Set collated=true, new_tip="$(git -C "${INTEG_WT}" rev-parse HEAD)".
6. Post an EVP on ${lp.id}: "collated onto ${INTEG_BRANCH} at <new_tip>; ships in the set PR."
Return the schema.`, { label:`collate:${lp.id.slice(0,8)}`, phase:'waves', schema:COLLATE })

    if (col && col.collated) {
