   - BOOT: \`BASEURL=$("${INTEG_WT}/scripts/ext-serve.sh" up "${INTEG_WT}" ${RUN_TAG}ui)\` — seeds a scratch DB and boots the backend + frontend (same-origin proxy), printing the base URL on stdout. Exit code 3 = the operator's own dev servers occupy the fixed ports → verdict=ESCALATE (a human must free the ports); any other non-zero exit → NEEDS_WORK with the printed error (e.g. a TS/build failure a UI ghost introduced).
